This repository contains work under several licenses. The SPDX tag at the top of each file is authoritative.

  GPL-2.0-only   Linux kernel patches and drivers (kernel/patches, kernel/third-party), unless a file says otherwise
  BSD-3-Clause   most device tree sources (dts/), as inherited from the upstream and ROCKNIX SoC description
  MIT            scripts (tools/, initramfs/, rootfs/), configuration files and documentation (docs/, READMEs)

Full license texts are in LICENSES/. Third-party material keeps its own license and authorship:
see kernel/third-party/README.md and docs/en/CREDITS.md.

Proprietary files (firmware, vendor drivers, Android images) are not part of this repository and are not licensed by it.

